<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Aug producer output prices fall 0.4 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish Aug producer output prices fall 0.4 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for the manufacturing industries fell 0.4 percent in August and were up 0.1 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>		  Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	   120.2		 -0.4		+0.1</p>
<p>Previous month	 120.7		 -0.2		+0.8</p>
<p>Year-ago month	 120.1		 +0.3		+3.0</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
